        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion 01-A9, Half Round Knobset with Square Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Half-Round Knob with Square Stepped Rose is a beautifully modern knobset perfect for contemporary homes. It is on the cutting edge of what is in style: classic designs, simple lines, and elegance. This half round knobset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Fusion Hardware's 01-A9 Knob will fit 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from 3 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion 01-A9 Half-Round Knob and Square Stepped Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive Fusion knob spring assembly for lifetime performance</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Traditional Door Knob Fusion 01 A9:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2”</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass and Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Half-Round Knob with Square Stepped Rose, Fusion 01-A9",
                "description": "Fusion 01-A9, Half-Round Knob with Square Stepped Rose - The Half-Round Knob with Square Stepped Rose is a beautifully modern knobset perfect for contemporary homes. It is on the cutting edge of what is in style: classic designs, simple lines, and elegance. This half round knobset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Fusion Hardware's 01-A9 Knob will fit 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from 3 finishes.",
